            <div xml:id="d707">

                <pb facs="0818" n="808" xml:id="pg808"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">121.67/12–1748: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Dairen</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Paddock</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dairen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-12-17">December 17,
                        1948</date>.<lb/>[Received December 19—5:21 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>239. Couriers Koval and Bernhardt arrived today, probably leave for Vladivostok
                    early next week.</p>
                <p>Department pass Moscow 105, Shanghai 166.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Paddock</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
